    "chunk_text": "\u00e6s halgan m\u00e6ssepreostes tid sancte Columba, JU09A3 Se com of Scottum to Breotone ond gel\u00e6rde Peohtas to fullwihte ond getimbrede him JU09A7 His wundra w\u00e6s sum \u00fe\u00e6t tu gesinhiwan spr\u00e6con ymb hine ealle niht, o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t hi sl\u00e6p JU09A9 \u00d0a ongan se tun bernan on \u00fe\u00e6re nihte, \u00fea forburnon ealle \u00feara monna hus \u00fee on \u00fe\u00e6m tune JU09A12 \u00d0a on morgenne het \u00fe\u00e6re \u00f0eode biscop \u00f0a gesinhiwan to him ond fr\u00e6gn hi mid hwi hi JU09A17 \u00d0a cw\u00e6don hi \u00fe\u00e6t hi na\u00feer ne scinncr\u00e6ftas cu\u00fean ne hi mid n\u00e6ngum godum weorcum JU09A22 \u00d0a ongeat se biscop \u00fe\u00e6t heora hus \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ron gescylde wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s fyres frecennisse, JU10A1 On \u00f0one teoge\u00fean d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 sancte Barnabes tid. JU10A2 Se w\u00e6s Cristes apostola discipul, for\u00f0\u00e6m his noma is gereaht on l\u00e6den filius consolationis, JU10A5 He w\u00e6s acenned on Cypro \u00fe\u00e6m ealonde, ond he w\u00e6s diacon \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan \u00e6 \u00feeawe. JU10A7 Ac he \u00fea gelyfde on Crist ond bebohte his lond ond \u00fe\u00e6t wear\u00f0 gesealde h\u00e6lendes \u00f0egnum JU15A1 On \u00feone fifteog\u00fean d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 sancte Vites \u00ferowung. JU15A2 He w\u00e6s seofon geara cniht \u00f0a he campode for Criste. JU15A3 \u00c6rest his f\u00e6der mid medum hine wolde",
